******************************************************************************
                                Functionality
******************************************************************************
.       Mouse support
.       Pull Down Menus with submenu support
.       Text mode programming emulated in a graphics environment
.       Graphics functions
.       Destroyable Windows
.       Graphical Buttons
.       Text field entry
.       Binary field entry
.       Scrollable menu
.       Scroll Bar Function
.       Percentage Bar Display Function
.       Hyper Text Help Facility
